{"id":77619,"slug":"invaze-2021","title":"Invaze","title_en":"Invasion","year":2021,"rating":59,"votes_count":1205,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Na Zemi zavítá mimozemský druh, který ohrožuje existenci lidstva. Děj se odvíjí v reálném čase pohledem pěti obyčejných lidí z různých koutů planety, snažících se nějak vyznat ve zmatku, který kolem nich propukl.(Apple TV+)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9ZOzWgRMws1hZQiCfHwFksNKg7.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i9IEOD1Li1y89xRHKH9kiE8dt9z.jpg","trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Drama","Sci-Fi"],"tags":["rodina","vojáci","armáda","mimozemšťané","invaze"],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Amanda Marsalis","Jamie Payne","Jakob Verbruggen","Alik Sakharov","Brad Anderson","Claudia Llosa","Mathias Herndl","Sylvain White","Daisy von Scherler Mayer"],"actors":["Sam Neill","Shamier Anderson","Golshifteh Farahani","Billy Barratt","Šiori Kucuna","Firas Nassar","Azhy Robertson","Paddy Holland","Tógo Igawa","Max Fincham","Isaac Heslip","Isla Johnston","Michael Harney","Noah Bean","Tom Cullen","Naoko Mori","Emily Althaus","Geraldine Singer","India Brown","Rinko Kikuči","Shingo Usami","Tamara Lawrance","Kathryn Erbe","Meg Gibson","Madia Hill Scott","Cathleen Trigg","Akie Kotabe","Sonia Okacha","Sarah Rich","Aziz Çapkurt","Dale Soules","Britt Faulkner","Debbie Campbell","Tara Moayedi","Ray Haratian","Samantha Colley","Joplin Sibtain","Gen Seto","Anamaria Marinca","Freddie Kuguru","Lina Alminas","Moe Bar-El","Rom Blanco","Adam Sopp","Michael Matus","Tobi Bamtefa","Konnie Huq","Yanis Charifi","Aiyana Goodfellow","Aubin Bradley","Sonia Mena","Richard Gallagher","Faith Edwards","Zac Looker","Robert Hobbs","Gordon Alexander","Enver Gjokaj","Naian González Norvind","Shane Zaza","Olivia-Mai Barrett","Craig Jackson","Natasha Loring","Takajuki Suzuki","Grant Swanby","Jack Devnarain","Alex Ross","Nedra Marie Taylor","Andre Jacobs","Raymond Neil Hernandez","Ai Barrett","Skye Russell","Alet Taylor","Levi Brown","Carey Van Driest","Nicholas Campbell","Chris Langa","Alex Dower","David Sullivan","Terry Chen","Henry Samiri","Aaron Pearl","Jaeden Noel","Eric Lange","Natalie Moon","Simon Arblaster","Darcey Johnson","Raf Rogers","Cheyenne Rouleau","Jenny Lee-Gilmore","Kurt Ostlund","Stefania Indelicato","Jess McLeod","Ted Cole","Leo Chiang","Kiarra Hamagami Goldberg","Aria Shahghasemi","Erika Alexander","Jill Morrison","Ashton Sanders","Alvina August","Curtis Lum","Mapuana Makia","Stephen Tracey","Aliyah O'Brien","Madeleine Kelders","Jason McKinnon","Ryan Mah","Ian Rozylo","Brenda Matthews","Ty Wood","Nhi Do","Anjali Jay","Byron Noble","Kwesi Ameyaw","Kathryn Alexandre","Joe Costa","Paul Lazenby","Jade Pawluk","Danny Dworkis","Shaine Jones","Trevor Hinton","Rachel Nichols","Brandon Nomura","Barbara Patrick","Emi Kamito","Yukari Komatsu","Stephen Adekolu","Leo Rano","Aaron Brooks","Fran Kranz","Conphidance","Aaron Stanford","Karimah Westbrook","Jonathan Watton","Greyston Holt","Eric Mazimpaka","Kazy Tauginas","Charlotte Ray","Julien Minet","Alice Lazarus","Scarlet Hunter","Julian Nelson"],"screenwriters":["Simon Kinberg","David Weil","Andrew Baldwin","Tatiana Suarez-Pico","Aditi Brennan Kapil","Dan Dietz","Donald Joh","Glenise Mullins","Vivian Barnes","Demetrios Cokinos"],"cinematographers":["Julian Court","Laurie Rose","Armando Salas","Tim Ives","Gavin Struthers","Baz Irvine","Thomas Burstyn","C. Kim Miles","Jon Joffin"],"composers":["Max Richter","Bobby Krlic"],"reviews":[{"author":"pilarius","text":"Největší botou tohohle díla je tempo. Buď to měli sfouknout během šesti dílů, nebo se za těch 10 dílů měl děj posunout mnohem dále. Druhou botou je to, kolik linek rozehráli a nedokončili - jako by si mysleli, že mají zaručené minimálně tři řady. O tom bohužel pochybuji. Co naopak musím pochválit, jsou herecké výkony zejména některých dětských herců.(18.12.2021)","stars":3},{"author":"majo0007","text":"Pozriete si Opening Credits - obrysy gigantických mimozemských lodí - poviete si, boha, to bude šupa! Bohužiaľ, nebola, pretože to v seriáli ani nie je. Scenáristická \"ekvilibristika\" vygradovala tým, ako Japonci zastavili inváziu - lesba poslala mimozemšťanom video súbory svojej jebačky (zrejme vo formáte DivX, s ktorým si nevedeli rady) a tí sa z toho tak posrali, že popadali od zlosti na zem. Wau-Wajo-Au!(13.12.2021)","stars":1},{"author":"Paldiny","text":"Typická Apple záležitosť. Zabudnite na krátke intro a konflikt po 15 minútach. Seriál si vás pekne povodí, rozbehne niekoľko samostatných línií, pričom najznámejšieho herca vyprevadí von po prvej epizóde. Dlho sa tu dramatizuje s pozemskými bolehlavmi - nevera, šikana, zakázaná láska. Invázia skrýva svoju tvár a len posúva figúrkami po atlase sveta naprieč tromi kontinentmi. Možno aj preto dve línie pretnú svoje pavučiny v akejsi londýnskej krčme až počas ôsmej epizódy. Onú zvláštnu pochmúrnu náladu, kedy by sa dotyčným zrútil svet zrejme aj bez invázie, dávajú do pohybu čoraz odvážnejšie pavúčiky. Napätie v ich prítomnosti vie byť sakra intenzívne a boj s nimi skôr len hrou o prežitie. Teda kým sa zrazu nenaskytne riešenie, teda rovno tri riešenia. A tým sa dostávame na záver prvej série s oslavnými chorálmi, kedy sa však divák tradičnú otázku nespýta. Nezaujíma ho, kedy dôjde na odvetu, lebo vie, že ďalšie série klopú na dvere. Zaujíma ho iná odpoveď, ktorá z tých troch zbraní napokon zabrala. Druhá séria je priamočiarejšia, všetko sa už točí okolo mimozemšťanov prechádzajúcich evolúciou. V štýle Walking Dead sa prestávame venovať všetkým linkám v jednej epizóde. A podobností je viac. Ani tu nechýbajú rodiace sa skupinky kooperujúce s vlastnými pravidlami a v provizórnych podmienkach. Z maminky Aneeshy sa stáva neohrozená Carol, čo zrovna nie je kompliment. Iné linky buď prešľapujú na mieste (exmariňák) alebo sa točia v kruhu (výskum). Ešteže detská misia má stále svoj priestor, pretože už ako jediná má v sebe to, čo ma priťahovalo v prvej sérii najviac. Predposledným dielom sa nám opäť začnú pruhy zužovať a my sa pomaly chystáme na veľké finále. Otázkou zostáva či sa nebude odohrávať iba v hlavách.(05.01.2026)","stars":null}],"vods":[{"platform":"Apple TV+","url":null},{"platform":"Apple TV","url":"https://srv.clickfuse.com/ads/adclkr.php?id=100006636&url=https%3A//tv.apple.com/cz/show/invasion/umc.cmc.70b7z97fv7azfzn5baqnj88p6"},{"platform":"Canal+","url":"https://www.canalplus.cz/stream/series/invaze/?utm_campaign=vod_content&utm_content=feed&utm_source=csfd&utm_medium=partner&utm_term="}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/1040032-invaze/prehled/","csfd_id":1040032,"root_id":1040032,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":3,"episode_count":30,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":7,"first_vod_date":"2021-10-29","last_vod_date":"2025-10-24","episodes":[{"season_no":1,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":"2021-10-29","title":"Král je mrtev (S01E04)","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":5,"vod_date":"2021-11-05","title":"Cesta domů (S01E05)","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":6,"vod_date":"2021-11-12","title":"Domácí invaze (S01E06)","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":7,"vod_date":"2021-11-19","title":"Naděje (S01E07)","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":8,"vod_date":"2021-11-26","title":"Kontakt (S01E08)","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":9,"vod_date":"2021-12-03","title":"Plno hvězd (S01E09)","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":10,"vod_date":"2021-12-10","title":"První den (S01E10)","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":2,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2023-08-23","title":"Něco se změnilo (S02E01)","platforms":["Apple TV","Canal+","Apple TV+"]},{"season_no":2,"episode_no":2,"vod